'''Electric Claw''' is a [[fighting style]] obtainable in the [[Third Sea]]. 

Electric Claw serves as an upgraded version to its predecessor, [[Electric]]. It lets the user wield neon blue claws, letting them channel electricity into slash and dash based attacks.   

It is mainly used in PvP due to its quick speed and moderately easy-to-hit, high stun, and powerful skills. Although it is recommended to avoid aerial PvP, since its moves work best on a surface.  

Electric Claw presents a somewhat steep learning-curve, but in return allows exceptional combo potential, due to {{Ability|C}} working as a perfect combo starter. The fighting style also greatly benefits under disabled screenshake. 

It is easy to grind with if the player has good mastery, since it has multi-target attacks. Its M1s however are not very reliable.

==Obtainment==
# Get 400 mastery on the [[Electric]] fighting style.
# Find the [[NPCs|NPC]], [[Previous Hero]], located left from the [[Longma]] boss under the many arches at the [[Floating Turtle]] in the [[Third Sea]]. 
# Talk to him and do his quest that requires the player to get to the [[Mansion (Third Sea)|Mansion]] in under 30 seconds. (''Tip: the player can set their spawn point to Mansion and use the [[Home Points|home button]], so the player teleports easily at [[Mansion (Third Sea)|Mansion]] in under 30 seconds or use the [[Portal]] fruit.'')
# After completing the quest, return to [[Previous Hero]].
# Pay the [[Previous Hero]] {{Money|3,000,000}} and {{Fragment|5,000}}. (After paying once, the player can equip [[Electric Claw]] from the [[Previous Hero]] anytime for free, like any other fighting style teacher.)

* The "{{Title|Raiton}}" [[Titles|title]] #0164 will be granted upon obtaining this fighting style.

==Mastery==
* 400+ Mastery: Electric Claw is one of the requirements to obtain [[Godhuman]].

