==Trivia==
* Somehow, the damage dealt to [[Sea Beast]]s with {{Ability|Z}} is measly. (Probably because only the final slashes are counted as physical attacks, and it deals most of damage)
* The player can use [[Flash Step]] while triggering {{Ability|Z}} or {{Ability|C}} (only for mobile users) by pressing [[Flash Step]] first, then using the move. This can be used for surprising enemies.
* Players can turn Electric Claw's M1's to something useful. Using an auto clicker and setting the click interval to one millisecond, players can glide because the M1's of this fighting style has a short dash. This is similar to [[Dragon Talon]].
* If the player has the [[Damage Counter]] turned on before using {{Ability|X}}, the damage counter will say 0 damage before it creates the explosion.
* If {{Ability|X}} is held down long enough (approximately 30 seconds), the electrical effects and sound will stop but nothing else changes.
* {{Ability|X}} can sometimes launch the user very far away if they have a low-end PC or high ping, making it great for traveling and running.
* Sometimes, {{Ability|X}} can glitch the user under an island and into the water in [[raids]]. (Usually when their ping is high).
* {{Ability|C}} sometimes glitches the user into the sea, killing them. The reason is unknown.
** {{Ability|C}} can also glitch the user under islands like [[Tiki Outpost]] and [[Sea of Treats]].
* {{Ability|X}} makes the same sound as the shock of a [[Piranha]].
* The Electric Claw is the only [[fighting style]] that has a model just like [[guns]] and [[swords]].
* With enough lag, {{Ability|Z}} cannot teleport the user.

